---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Burgas Nightlife & Eurovision 2027 Afterparties" 
  description="The ultimate guide to Burgas nightlife during Eurovision 2027. Discover the best clubs, beach bars, EuroClub locations, and VIP party access."
  breadcrumb="Nightlife"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h1 class="text-gradient" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Burgas Nightlife & Eurovision 2027 Afterparties</h1>
      
      <p class="lead" style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 40px; color: var(--text-muted);">
        When the shows end, the real party begins. Burgas transforms into a massive coastal celebration during Eurovision. Here is your guide to the clubs, the beach bars, and securing VIP tables.
      </p>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>The Official EuroClub & EuroVillage</h2>
        <p>The beating heart of Eurovision nightlife. The <strong>EuroVillage</strong> (free, public) will likely be located in the Sea Garden, offering daytime concerts and sponsor zones. The <strong>EuroClub</strong> (accreditation or OGAE required) is where delegations, press, and hardcore fans mingle.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Location:</strong> To be confirmed, but expect major venues near the Port of Burgas or Sea Station (Магазия 1).</li>
          <li><strong>Vibe:</strong> Non-stop Eurovision hits, drag performances, and live delegation acts.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>The Beach Bars (Central Beach & North Beach)</h2>
        <p>Burgas has a unique nightlife culture centered right on the sand. During May, the weather warms up, and the beach bars along the central promenade open for the season.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Saxe Beach Club:</strong> Upscale, cocktails, deep house.</li>
          <li><strong>HashtagSTUDIO:</strong> Great for pre-drinks and a younger crowd.</li>
          <li><strong>Kite Bar:</strong> Laid-back, bohemian vibe, slightly further north.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px;"><em>Tip:</em> Dress codes are usually relaxed at beach bars, but smart-casual is recommended for late-night clubs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-magenta);">
        <h3>👑 VIP Table Booking & Private Yachts</h3>
        <p>Want to skip the queues? We have direct contacts with the top club managers in Burgas. <strong>Fill in your details below, we will contact you and personally arrange your VIP access and table reservations.</strong></p>
        
        <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" style="margin-top: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
          <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="03b548cb-5509-4e30-91a0-785800f9f395" />
          <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="VIP Nightlife Reservation Request" />
          
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;">
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name or Delegation" required style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" />
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" />
          </div>
          
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;">
            <input type="number" name="people" placeholder="Number of People" required style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" />
            <select name="interest" style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" required>
              <option value="" disabled selected>What are you looking for?</option>
              <option value="Club VIP Table">EuroClub / Beach Club VIP Table</option>
              <option value="Private Yacht">Private Yacht Party</option>
              <option value="Both">Both (Full VIP Experience)</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <textarea name="details" rows="3" placeholder="Tell us more about your group or specific requests..." style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;" required></textarea>
          
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 14px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem;">Request VIP Access</button>
        </form>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  
  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  
  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>

